              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka jowok dok, jolaneno delkwoŋ ji ma jogwenyere kwoŋan. Kudin ma jocamo jo jokilatho, aka mac ma waŋo jokilaneko. Ji jokilamito kiri neno jo.",
          "type": "text",
